	"Description": "I love\u00A0sqbr's\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/13694]Starry Blue UI[/url]. But you know what else I love? Purple. And you know what else? Permissions were open. So I've recolored the Starry Blue UI to be Galaxy Purple! Yaaaay purple!\n<br />\n<br />In addition to the overall UI, I've recolored\u00A0MarsCBG's \uFEFF[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/24625]Starry Blue UI Portrait Border\u00A0[/url]and\u00A0cookietehcat's\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/21682]Compatibility Patches For Starry Blue UI[/url], both of which also had open permissions, and a patch or two of my own for seamless integration. Just download from the optional files and overwrite mods as needed.\n<br />\n<br />Optional patches include compatibility for:\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />-Better Crafting\n<br />-Crafting Collection\n<br />-FontSettings\n<br />-Generic Mod Config Menu\n<br />-Quality Smash\n<br />-Spacecore\n<br />-Unofficial Mod Update Menu\n<br />-Unlockable Bundles\n<br />-EventLookup\n<br />-DeluxeJournal\n<br />-Happy Home Designer\n<br />-Animated Inventory Tabs\n<br />-Ferngill Simple Economy\n<br />-Love of Cooking\n<br />-Remote Fridge Storage\n<br />-Mobile UI Patch (courtesy of mckat!)\n<br />-Virtual Keyboard Patch (courtesy of mckat!)\n<br />\n<br />(all assets had open permissions or had permissions given)\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />Enjoy!\n<br />\n<br />Edit: Version 2.0 has had some integration and coloring improvements thanks to MarsCBG!\n<br />\n<br />~Like my work? [url=https://ko-fi.com/silvermoonchan]Buy me a coffee![/url] ☕ ",
